## Checklist item format

Each numbered item follows this template:

```
N. <Task> — ssl_search: «<Russian query>» → use the discovered API;
   optional: its_help → fetch_its for platform standard;
   at wiring time: search_metadata / codesearch to confirm subsystem exists in target IB;
   project-delta: <one project rule if applicable>.
```

**`ssl_search` limitation (honest):** it searches **BSP documentation**, not live configuration metadata. A subsystem may exist in BSP but be disabled or renamed in a specific configuration — the runtime confirm step remains mandatory when wiring.

