## Multi-extension layout (pointer)

When several CFE extensions touch the same adopted object:

1. Prefer **one extension per functional area**; avoid duplicating interceptors on the same method across extensions.
2. Modification priority — `dev-standards-architecture.mdc §2`: event subscriptions → extensions → typical code.
3. `&ИзменениеИКонтроль` / platform `&Вместо` — **last resort**; details in `extension-patterns.mdc`.
4. dev-rules reference: `docs/extensions.md` (strategy only — verify against project `extension-patterns.mdc`).
